WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.810
Today you decide which feeling root is in each word:

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:07.130
the one for emotion, or the one for the senses.

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:10.260
Then sort words by where the stress falls.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:14.380
Say each word twice, leaning on a different beat each time.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.350
Only one way sounds right.
